{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes: Peeka is a sweet, quiet, and curious girl with a playful side and a heart full of affection. She loves exploring, playing, and enjoying peaceful surroundings. She's also a little lady who appreciates having her personal space respected! Peeka likes to decide when it's cuddle time and will reward you with affection when she's ready. She doesn't enjoy being overstimulated or touched without warning, so she thrives with someone who understands her boundaries and lets her personality shine at her own pace.\n\nPeeka would make a wonderful companion in a calm, loving home, ideally with adults or older, respectful children. Give her patience, space, and love, and you'll earn the trust of a very special little friend.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=14&searchType=4&animalid=208904","id":"312b56c4a406813f4ec38a700de003cb","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/9fea86dafaa34e4f80e598fa08ae29d0-1793645912-1793645930-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/6bc0e725a4e0455b82f935a208f87927-1793645915-1793645915-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/3f896032fe0b4c1f8da36ff60dfc199f-1793645914-1793645914-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/c2e6f947105c40e795ab754f623531f6-1793645914-1793645914-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/b0fe65bdfe7d4baeb433bf63bc0367f0-1793645913-1793645913-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/137183d9a67449f983452567e6955bac-1793645911-1793645911-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/73d3d20a8e7e45cc9f9adfe48034d5ca-1793645910-179